  "dct_description_sm": [
    "We have assessed primary and secondary roads for signs of road blockages in the *La Guaira, Districto Capital, Yaracuy and Carabobo* regions of Venezuela. The latest updated data, uses imagery dated **5th July**. The data is held in a shapefile format using the WGS 84 EPSG: 4326 projection. You can find the Planetary Response Network Mozambique Flooding 2026 project we ran [here](https://www.zooniverse.org/projects/alicemead/planetary-response-network-venezuela-earthquake-2026). This is crowd sourced data."
